{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>These are the heads of their fathers' houses.</b> Concerning Moses and Aaron, or return to the children of Israel mentioned above. And the men are those who went down to Egypt. And he begins with Reuben, for no honor remained to him except to be listed first. And these four sons of his are those who went down to Egypt:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:08.035661218Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}